 Dev | `expert_frontend_dev` | Web frontend, React/Vue, CSS/UI |\n| 🖥️ Backend Dev | `ex"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"pert_backend_dev` | API, server logic, authentication |\n| 🗄️ Database | `expert_database` | Schema d"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"esign, SQL, optimization |\n| 🏗️ Architect | `expert_architect` | System design, tech selection |\n| 🛠"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"️ DevOps | `expert_devops` | CI/CD, Docker, K8s, deployment |\n| 🧪 QA Engineer | `expert_qa_engineer`"},{"id":"p17s5","text":" | Testing strategy, automation |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### 🔒 Security & Data (3)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Expert | Tool | Domain |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| 🔒 Security | `expert_security` | Code audit, vulnerabilities, hardening |\n| 📊 Data Analyst | `expe"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"rt_data_analyst` | Statistics, visualization, insights |\n| 🎨 UI/UX Design | `expert_uiux_design` | I"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"nterface design, design systems |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### 💼 Business (7)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Expert | Tool | Domain |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| 📋 Product Manager | `expert_product_manager` | PRD, requirements, competitor research |\n| ✍️ Copyw"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"riter | `expert_copywriter` | Marketing copy, content creation |\n| 🎬 Media Creator | `expert_media_c"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"reator` | Storyboard, AI image, AI video, final cut |\n| ⚖️ Legal Review | `expert_legal_review` | Co"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"ntract review, legal risk |\n| 📱 Social Media | `expert_social_media` | Multi-platform distribution |"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"\n| 🚀 Growth Hacker | `expert_growth` | Growth strategy, A/B testing |\n| 💹 Quant Finance | `expert_qu"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"ant_finance` | Quantitative models, risk |\n| 💰 Finance | `expert_finance` | Financial analysis, budg"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"finance` | Quantitative models, risk |\n| 💰 Finance | `expert_finance` | Financial analysis, budget |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## 🛡️ Features"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Feature | Description |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| 🎯 **Smart Delegation** | Auto-identifies task domain and routes to the best expert |\n| 🚀 **Fast Tr"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ack** | Simple tasks handled directly — no forced delegation |\n| 🔄 **Five-Anchor Constraint** | Prev"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ents topic drift with per-turn self-check |\n| 🤝 **Cross Review** | High-risk tasks get multi-expert "},{"id":"p26s4","text":"independent review |\n| 💾 **Experience Pool** | Lessons learned are saved and injected next time |\n| "},{"id":"p26s5","text":"💬 **Inter-Expert Bus** | File-based message bus (bus.py): experts send/read directly, zero coordinat"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"or relay, P2P capable |\n| 📋 **Taskboard** | File-system task scheduler (taskboard.py): pending/ready"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"/running/done/failed state machine, dependency DAG, retry, crash recovery — real scheduling, not jus"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"t chat coordination |\n| 🚦 **Quality Gates** | 5-stage pipeline for high-risk tasks: requirement clar"},{"id":"p26s9","text":"ity → implementation → verification → review → integration. Independent-expert review with 2-round r"},{"id":"p26s10","text":"ework limit |\n| ⚡ **Fault Recovery** | Auto-retry on timeout, strategy switch on failure |\n| 📉 **Pro"},{"id":"p26s11","text":"gressive Disclosure** | Methodology injected on-demand, 28% token savings |\n| 🌐 **Bilingual** | Comp"},{"id":"p26s12","text":"lete EN/ZH documentation |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 📦 Installation"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Option A: npm one-click (recommended) 🚀"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The package is published on npm as `dsh-expert-mode`. You can install it with the DSH plugin manager"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"blished on npm as `dsh-expert-mode`. You can install it with the DSH plugin manager or npm directly:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"> ℹ️ **How agent-presets work**: this is an **agent-preset plugin**, not a Cordis service plugin. In"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"stalling the npm package pulls all files into your `node_modules` — but the preset only **activates*"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"* once its files are mounted into DSH's preset discovery directory. The preset ships a copy step (be"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"low) that makes this one command."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Option B: One-command preset mount (recommended for activation)"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"After installing the npm package, mount the preset into DSH's preset discovery directory:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"> **Note**: `~/.dsh/.agent-presets/` is DSH's preset discovery directory. Each subdirectory = one pr"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"eset. The preset name comes from `preset.yml`'s `name` field."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Option C: Manual install from GitHub"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Clone the repository, then copy the preset into DSH's agent-presets directory:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"> **Note**: `~/.dsh/.agent-presets/` is DSH's preset discovery directory. Each subdirectory = one pr"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"eset. The preset name comes from `preset.yml`'s `name` field."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Then select **\"专家模式\"** in the workspace preset selector."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### Optional: Cross-session memory (recommended)"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"The expert-mode preset itself does **not** register the cross-session memory service — it is a HOST-"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"PLANE plugin, and registering it inside a preset conflicts with the host composition (causing preset"},{"id":"p42s3","text":" mount failure). To enable cross-session memory, install dsh-memory-connect separately into the **ho"},{"id":"p42s4","text":"To enable cross-session memory, install dsh-memory-connect separately into the **host composition**:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Important**: **Do NOT** add `@deepseek-ai/dsh-memory-connect` into this preset's `agent.cordi"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"s.yml`. It is a HOST-PLANE plugin (injects `sessions` + `systemPrompt`); registering it inside the p"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"reset throws `service has been registered at <cross-session-memory>`, which makes the expert-mode pr"},{"id":"p44s4","text":"eset fail to mount and the UI fall back to the default preset. This preset ships with an explanatory"},{"id":"p44s5","text":" and the UI fall back to the default preset. This preset ships with an explanatory comment about it."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## 🏗️ Architecture"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
